{"id":"wb-6-662","name":"荆州万寿宝塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"万寿宝塔","text":"万寿宝塔位于中国湖北省荆州市沙市区西南部荆江大堤观音矶头上，为明代楼阁式砖塔，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n明嘉靖二十七年（1548年），辽王朱宪遵嫡母毛太妃之命为皇帝祈寿而建万寿宝塔，历时四年竣工。清道光五年（1825年）以铁箍加固外壁。1952年加高荆江大堤后，宝塔底层没入大堤地面下。塔为八角七层楼阁式砖石塔，高40.46米。塔基为石质须弥座，高1.14米，边长5.9米。塔身中空，内有石质旋梯通往顶层。塔门均南向。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%87%E5%AF%BF%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85468215,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85468215","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7c9c4aa258cd53e7e64c618d.jpg","title":"Jingzhou_Wanshou_Baota_2014.04.20_15-51-34.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jingzhou_Wanshou_Baota_2014.04.20_15-51-34.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/Jingzhou_Wanshou_Baota_2014.04.20_15-51-34.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"荆州万寿宝塔——\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}